---
description: Global fallback constraints for the entire monorepo workspace
globs: "*"
alwaysApply: true
---
# Workspace Core Directives
- **System Automation**: The project relies on Nix Flakes and Docker. Do not suggest global OS-level mutations.
- **Scripting**: Shell scripts must specify `#!/usr/bin/env bash`, fail fast (`set -e`), and be fully POSIX compliant.
- **Formatting**: Rely on Biome/Prettier. Do not manually format code in responses unless requested.
